      "rationale": "Labels every entry of the measured source inventory, without filtering. For a tree comparison the label is the unexplained-changes lane's bucket of the path (Mapped, Unmapped or Attribution unknown), 'Attribution pending' while the lane is being read, and unknown when the lane could not be read. For a dataset review it comes from the backend's attributed and unattributed changed-path lists, and a path in neither list is shown as unknown rather than inferred unmapped.",
      "role": "presentation"
